{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901029460010","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～\r\nこれ雛菜の～？","trans":"啊哈～\n这个是雛菜的～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ、美味しいかわからないけど\r\nよかったら","trans":"嗯，虽然不知道合不合你口味\n不嫌弃的话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029460020","name":"雛菜","text":"うん～\r\nじゃあ今食べて美味しいか教えてあげる！","trans":"嗯～\n那我现在就吃，然后告诉你好不好吃！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029460030","name":"雛菜","text":"あ、\r\nプロデューサーも一個食べたい～？","trans":"啊，\n制作人也想吃一个～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え、いや\r\n俺は────……","trans":"诶，不了\n我────……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029460040","name":"雛菜","text":"あ～……ん～～～～～","trans":"啊～……嗯～～～～～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029460050","name":"雛菜","text":"これおいしい～～～","trans":"这个好好吃～～～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お、そうか？\r\nよかったよ","trans":"哦，是吗？\n那就好","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"雛菜にもらったやつも\r\n美味かったからな","trans":"雛菜送我的那个\n也很好吃啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029460060","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～\r\nじゃあこれも、はい～","trans":"啊哈～\n那这个也给你，来～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901029460070","name":"雛菜","text":"あ～んして～！","trans":"来，啊～张嘴～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}